FACT THIS WAR HAS JUST BEGUN.

00:06:37.864 --> 00:06:39.532 line:78%
WATCH.

00:06:38.231 --> 00:06:43.569 line:78%
&gt;&gt; ONE THING IS REALLY CLEAR,

00:06:39.632 --> 00:06:45.538 line:78%
THAT THIS DELEGATION WANTED

00:06:43.669 --> 00:06:47.673 line:78%
TO -- BE VERY CLEAR WITH HIS

00:06:45.638 --> 00:06:49.142 line:78%
MOST RECENT AID PACKAGE REQUEST.

