WE ARE NOT INTERESTED IN

00:06:59.018 --> 00:07:00.052 line:78%
STALEMATES.

00:06:59.419 --> 00:07:01.487 line:78%
WE ARE NOT INTERESTED IN GOING

00:07:00.153 --> 00:07:04.490 line:78%
BACK TO THE STATUS QUO.

00:07:01.587 --> 00:07:05.525 line:78%
THE UNITED STATES OF AMERICA IS

00:07:04.590 --> 00:07:07.593 line:78%
IN THIS TO WIN IT AND WE WILL

00:07:05.625 --> 00:07:09.562 line:78%
STAND WITH UKRAINE UNTIL VICTORY

00:07:08.995 --> 00:07:10.229 line:78%
IS WON.

00:07:09.662 --> 00:07:14.133 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Tucker: THAT WAS CONGRESS

00:07:10.329 --> 00:07:15.735 line:78%
WHEN JASON CROW, A CONFIRMED

00:07:14.233 --> 00:07:19.772 line:78%
BUFFOON, TELLING US THAT WE ARE

00:07:15.835 --> 00:07:20.306 line:78%
NOT IN IT TO ACHIEVE A 

00:07:19.906 --> 00:07:20.573 line:78%
STALEMATE.

