SOME OF US WERE UNDER THE

00:07:21.641 --> 00:07:23.643 line:78%
IMPRESSION BASED ON THEIR'S

00:07:22.875 --> 00:07:24.877 line:78%
PUBLIC STATEMENTS THAT WE WERE

00:07:23.743 --> 00:07:26.479 line:78%
DEFENDING THE SOVEREIGNTY OF

00:07:24.977 --> 00:07:27.880 line:78%
ANOTHER COUNTRY, UKRAINE.

00:07:26.579 --> 00:07:29.515 line:78%
BUT IT'S NOT UP TO US, IT'S UP

00:07:28.047 --> 00:07:31.117 line:78%
