HERE IS THE CONGRESSMAN TELLING

00:07:31.951 --> 00:07:35.288 line:78%
US WE ARE NOT GOING TO ACCEPT A

00:07:33.453 --> 00:07:36.722 line:78%
"STALEMATE."

00:07:35.388 --> 00:07:37.790 line:78%
WE ARE IN IT TO WIN IT.

00:07:36.823 --> 00:07:40.526 line:78%
WE'RE GOING TO WIN, WE ARE HERE

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:41.861 line:78%
UNTIL WE GET VICTORY.

