HOW DO WE KNOW WHEN WE WON?

00:07:45.765 --> 00:07:48.534 line:78%
HE DIDN'T TELL US.

00:07:47.433 --> 00:07:49.101 line:78%
AND NEITHER, BY THE WAY, DID

00:07:48.634 --> 00:07:50.536 line:78%
NANCY PELOSI.

00:07:49.202 --> 00:07:51.471 line:78%
SHE JUST THAT WE ARE GOING TO

00:07:50.636 --> 00:07:55.641 line:78%
KEEP SENDING WEAPONS TO UKRAINE

00:07:51.571 --> 00:07:59.479 line:78%
"UNTIL THE FIGHT IS DONE."

00:07:57.043 --> 00:08:03.449 line:78%
&gt;&gt; TO SAY THANK YOU FOR YOUR

00:07:59.579 --> 00:08:06.085 line:78%
FIGHT OF FREEDOM, AND THAT YOUR

00:08:03.549 --> 00:08:06.853 line:78%
FIGHT IS A FIGHT FOR EVERYONE.

