AND SO OUR COMMITMENT IS TO BE

00:08:06.953 --> 00:08:12.859 line:78%
THERE FOR YOU UNTIL THE FIGHT IS

00:08:11.524 --> 00:08:15.061 line:78%
DONE.

00:08:12.959 --> 00:08:15.528 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Tucker: HOW DID WE GET HERE

00:08:15.161 --> 00:08:16.028 line:78%
EXACTLY?

00:08:15.628 --> 00:08:18.931 line:78%
