IF YOU'RE ONE OF THE MILLIONS OF

00:08:19.031 --> 00:08:21.634 line:78%
GOOD-HEARTED AMERICANS WHO PUT A

00:08:20.366 --> 00:08:22.635 line:78%
UKRAINIAN FLAG PIN ON YOUR LAPEL

