OR PUT ONE IN FRONT OF HER HOUSE

00:08:22.735 --> 00:08:25.838 line:78%
EXPRESSING SOLIDARITY WITH THE

00:08:25.204 --> 00:08:26.706 line:78%
POOR, OPPRESSED PEOPLE OF

00:08:25.938 --> 00:08:27.707 line:78%
UKRAINE, YOU PROBABLY DIDN'T

00:08:26.806 --> 00:08:29.408 line:78%
THINK YOU ARE SIGNING UP FOR

00:08:29.208 --> 00:08:30.109 line:78%
THIS.

