NANCY PELOSI TELLING US WE ARE

00:08:30.943 --> 00:08:36.482 line:78%
IN A WAR WITH A NUCLEAR ARMED

00:08:32.678 --> 00:08:38.651 line:78%
POWER WITH NO CLEAR END GAME.

00:08:36.582 --> 00:08:39.585 line:78%
SEEN THAT MOVIE BEFORE?

00:08:38.751 --> 00:08:40.920 line:78%
WE JUST FINISHED ONE AFTER 20

00:08:39.685 --> 00:08:43.689 line:78%
YEARS IN AFGHANISTAN.

00:08:41.020 --> 00:08:44.423 line:78%
WILL IT LOOK LIKE THAT?

00:08:43.789 --> 00:08:47.126 line:78%
THIS IS AN OPEN-ENDED CONFLICT,

00:08:44.524 --> 00:08:47.960 line:78%
SAID NANCY PELOSI, JUST LIKE THE

00:08:47.226 --> 00:08:49.428 line:78%
WAR ON TERROR, AND JUST IN CASE

00:08:48.060 --> 00:08:49.795 line:78%
YOU MISSED IT, THEY ALL REPEATED

00:08:49.529 --> 00:08:52.465 line:78%
THAT LINE.

00:08:49.896 --> 00:08:53.666 line:78%
HERE'S HER NIGHTMARE AGAIN,

00:08:52.565 --> 00:08:55.601 line:78%
ADAM SCHIFF IN CHARGE OF THE WAR

00:08:53.766 --> 00:08:56.536 line:78%
AGAINST RUSSIA.

00:08:55.701 --> 00:08:57.203 line:78%
WATCH.

00:08:56.636 --> 00:08:58.671 line:78%
&gt;&gt; THE WHOLE FREEDOM LOVING

00:08:57.303 --> 00:09:01.340 line:78%
WORLD HAS AN INTEREST IN THE

00:08:58.771 --> 00:09:03.342 line:78%
OUTCOME OF THIS WAR AND ENSURING

00:09:01.440 --> 00:09:04.277 line:78%
THAT UKRAINE IS VICTORIOUS, AND

00:09:03.442 --> 00:09:05.011 line:78%
WE ARE DETERMINED TO DO

00:09:04.377 --> 00:09:06.546 line:78%
EVERYTHING IN OUR POWER TO MAKE

00:09:06.312 --> 00:09:09.115 line:78%
IT SO.

00:09:06.846 --> 00:09:12.351 line:78%
WE ARE PROUD TO STAND SHOULDER

00:09:09.215 --> 00:09:14.020 line:78%
TO SHOULDER WITH UKRAINE, AND WE

00:09:12.451 --> 00:09:14.687 line:78%
WILL.

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:16.088 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Tucker: THESE PEOPLE ARE

00:09:14.787 --> 00:09:17.423 line:78%
PLAYING DRESS-UP.

00:09:16.188 --> 00:09:18.858 line:78%
THEY HAVE NO IDEA WHAT THEY'RE

00:09:17.523 --> 00:09:19.292 line:78%
TALKING ABOUT, AND THEY DON'T

00:09:18.958 --> 00:09:21.027 line:78%
CARE.

