THEY GET TO PRETEND TO BE

00:09:21.127 --> 00:09:23.930 line:78%
STATESMAN FOR A DAY.

00:09:21.694 --> 00:09:25.565 line:78%
BUT WHEN ADAM SCHIFF AND

00:09:24.030 --> 00:09:26.766 line:78%
NANCY PELOSI -- AGAIN, PEOPLE

00:09:25.665 --> 00:09:30.269 line:78%
WITH A DEMONSTRATED, YEARS LONG

00:09:26.866 --> 00:09:31.504 line:78%
RECORD OF BEING WILLING TO SAY

00:09:30.369 --> 00:09:32.271 line:78%
ANYTHING FOR PERSONAL POWER,

00:09:31.604 --> 00:09:34.206 line:78%
ANYTHING TO IMPROVE THE FORTUNES

00:09:32.371 --> 00:09:34.974 line:78%
OF THE LOCAL PARTY -- WHEN THEY

00:09:34.307 --> 00:09:37.610 line:78%
ARE STANDING UP WITH A FOREIGN

00:09:35.074 --> 00:09:40.112 line:78%
HEAD OF STATE SAYING THERE'S AN

00:09:37.710 --> 00:09:40.780 line:78%
OPEN CHECK, YOU FILL IN THE

00:09:40.212 --> 00:09:42.214 line:78%
NUMBER, YOU'VE GOT TO WONDER

00:09:40.880 --> 00:09:45.918 line:78%
WHERE THIS IS GOING.

00:09:42.315 --> 00:09:48.154 line:78%
WE KNOW WHERE IT COULD GO.

00:09:46.018 --> 00:09:50.089 line:78%
THIS IS THE MOST RECKLESS

00:09:48.254 --> 00:09:50.656 line:78%
FOREIGN POLICY IN OUR LIFETIMES,

00:09:50.189 --> 00:09:52.325 line:78%
IN AMERICAN HISTORY.

00:09:50.756 --> 00:09:54.827 line:78%
YOU ARE WATCHING A GROUP OF

00:09:52.425 --> 00:09:55.695 line:78%
DECADENT AND SOME CASES SENILE

00:09:54.927 --> 00:09:56.529 line:78%
LEADERS CASUALLY DISMISS THE

00:09:55.795 --> 00:09:59.098 line:78%
CONSEQUENCES OF GOING TO WAR

00:09:56.629 --> 00:10:00.566 line:78%
WITH A NUCLEAR ARMED NATION.

00:09:59.198 --> 00:10:02.301 line:78%
DISMISS THE CONSEQUENCES OF

00:10:00.666 --> 00:10:02.868 line:78%
NUCLEAR WAR LIKE IT'S NOT EVEN

00:10:02.401 --> 00:10:04.270 line:78%
WORTH THINKING ABOUT.

00:10:02.969 --> 00:10:06.906 line:78%
BUT IT IS WORTH THINKING ABOUT.

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:07.673 line:78%
THEY TELL US DAILY

00:10:07.006 --> 00:10:09.675 line:78%
VLADIMIR PUTIN IS EVIL AND

00:10:07.773 --> 00:10:11.944 line:78%
INSANE, AND THAT MAY WELL BE

00:10:09.775 --> 00:10:12.778 line:78%
TRUE, BUT THIS SAME MAN HAS

00:10:12.044 --> 00:10:13.312 line:78%
THREATENED TO USE NUCLEAR

00:10:12.878 --> 00:10:14.981 line:78%
WEAPONS AGAINST THE

00:10:13.412 --> 00:10:15.748 line:78%
UNITED STATES AND WESTERN EUROPE

00:10:15.081 --> 00:10:17.950 line:78%
IF THIS CONTINUES, AND WHY DON'T

00:10:17.016 --> 00:10:19.585 line:78%
WE BELIEVE HIM?

00:10:18.050 --> 00:10:20.486 line:78%
YOU MAY HAVE MISSED THIS,

00:10:19.685 --> 00:10:22.254 line:78%
"THE NEW YORK TIMES" DIDN'T SEEM

00:10:20.586 --> 00:10:24.290 line:78%
TO HAVE TIME TO COVER IT.

00:10:22.355 --> 00:10:25.625 line:78%
BUT HERE'S RUSSIA'S FOREIGN

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:26.225 line:78%
MINISTER JUST LAST WEEK

00:10:25.725 --> 00:10:28.327 line:78%
UNDERSCORING THE POINT.

00:10:26.325 --> 00:10:29.295 line:78%
&gt;&gt; RUSSIAN FOREIGN MINISTER WITH

00:10:28.427 --> 00:10:32.064 line:78%
A CHILLING WARNING, THE RISK OF

00:10:29.395 --> 00:10:34.634 line:78%
NUCLEAR WAR IS A REAL ONE.

00:10:32.164 --> 00:10:36.736 line:78%
SPEAKING TO STATE RUN MEDIA, HE

00:10:34.734 --> 00:10:38.004 line:78%
SAID "THE DANGER WAS SERIOUS,

00:10:36.836 --> 00:10:38.471 line:78%
ISRAEL, IT CANNOT BE UNDER

00:10:38.104 --> 00:10:39.772 line:78%
ESTIMATED."

00:10:38.838 --> 00:10:42.241 line:78%
HE ADDED THAT HE DID NOT WANT TO

00:10:39.872 --> 00:10:45.077 line:78%
SEE THE RISK TO NUCLEAR WAR

00:10:42.341 --> 00:10:47.079 line:78%
"ARTIFICIALLY INFLATED."

00:10:45.177 --> 00:10:50.650 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Tucker: HE DOES NOT SEE IT

00:10:47.179 --> 00:10:54.220 line:78%
AS AN ARTIFICIALLY INFLATED.

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:56.255 line:78%
SO WHAT THEY ARE SAYING IS WE

00:10:54.320 --> 00:10:59.258 line:78%
WILL USE NUCLEAR WEAPONS AGAINST

00:10:56.355 --> 00:11:00.126 line:78%
YOU AND YOUR ALLIES IF YOU DON'T

00:10:59.358 --> 00:11:02.061 line:78%
BACK OFF.

00:11:00.226 --> 00:11:02.828 line:78%
IF, FOR EXAMPLE, THIS SEEMS

00:11:02.161 --> 00:11:03.429 line:78%
EXISTENTIAL, LIKE YOU'RE TRYING

00:11:02.928 --> 00:11:05.064 line:78%
TRYING TO OVERTHROW OUR

00:11:03.529 --> 00:11:06.265 line:78%
GOVERNMENT.

00:11:05.164 --> 00:11:07.767 line:78%
IT'S HARDLY IN DEFENSE OF RUSSIA

00:11:06.532 --> 00:11:08.968 line:78%
TO SAY THAT'S A POSSIBILITY, AND

00:11:07.867 --> 00:11:11.837 line:78%
HAS BEEN FOR QUITE SOME TIME.

00:11:09.368 --> 00:11:12.571 line:78%
SO IT WAS TWO YEARS AGO THAT

00:11:11.937 --> 00:11:13.906 line:78%
VLADIMIR PUTIN REVISED RUSSIA'S

00:11:12.672 --> 00:11:15.675 line:78%
NUCLEAR DETERRENT POLICY.

00:11:14.006 --> 00:11:16.442 line:78%
THE NEW POLICY ALLOWS RUSSIA TO

00:11:15.775 --> 00:11:18.110 line:78%
USE NUCLEAR WEAPONS IN RESPONSE

00:11:16.542 --> 00:11:19.111 line:78%
TO A CONVENTIONAL STRIKE.

00:11:18.210 --> 00:11:22.014 line:78%
THAT MEANS SOME SORT OF

00:11:20.913 --> 00:11:24.350 line:78%
NONNUCLEAR PROVOCATION.

00:11:22.748 --> 00:11:25.051 line:78%
IN MARCH, RUSSIA'S FORMER

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:25.851 line:78%
PRESIDENT DMITRY MEDVEDEV, WHO

00:11:25.184 --> 00:11:27.820 line:78%
SITS ON RUSSIA'S SECURITY

00:11:25.951 --> 00:11:28.220 line:78%
COUNCIL, REMINDED OUR COUNTRY OF

00:11:27.920 --> 00:11:31.657 line:78%
THIS POLICY.

00:11:28.320 --> 00:11:33.693 line:78%
HE WARNED JOE BIDEN THAT RUSSIA

00:11:31.757 --> 00:11:34.627 line:78%
WOULD INDEED USE NUCLEAR WEAPONS

00:11:33.793 --> 00:11:37.263 line:78%
AGAINST THE WEST IN RESPONSE TO

00:11:34.727 --> 00:11:39.098 line:78%
ANY "ACT OF AGGRESSION" THAT IS

00:11:37.363 --> 00:11:39.465 line:78%
COMMITTED AGAINST RUSSIA AND ITS

00:11:39.198 --> 00:11:41.634 line:78%
ALLIES.

00:11:39.565 --> 00:11:42.435 line:78%
WHAT WOULD THAT LOOK LIKE?

00:11:41.734 --> 00:11:43.602 line:78%
WOULD INCLUDE HELPING TO SHOOT

00:11:42.535 --> 00:11:45.705 line:78%
DOWN A RUSSIAN TRANSPORT PLANE

00:11:43.703 --> 00:11:46.038 line:78%
CARRYING HUNDREDS OF RUSSIAN

00:11:45.805 --> 00:11:49.075 line:78%
TROOPS?

00:11:46.138 --> 00:11:49.375 line:78%
THE PENTAGON HAS ADMITTED DOING

00:11:49.175 --> 00:11:50.109 line:78%
THAT.

00:11:49.475 --> 00:11:52.111 line:78%
YOU DON'T HAVE TO BE FOR RUSSIA

00:11:50.710 --> 00:11:53.746 line:78%
TO SEE THAT AS A PRETTY RECKLESS

00:11:52.611 --> 00:11:55.014 line:78%
ACT AND NOT JUST DOING IT BUT

00:11:53.913 --> 00:11:55.381 line:78%
THEN BRAGGING ABOUT IT TO

00:11:55.114 --> 00:11:57.583 line:78%
NBC NEWS.

00:11:55.481 --> 00:11:58.384 line:78%
WHERE DOES THAT GET US?

00:11:57.683 --> 00:12:01.754 line:78%
WE SHOULD FIND OUT.

00:12:00.319 --> 00:12:03.656 line:78%
WE DO KNOW THAT PUTIN HAS PLACED

00:12:01.854 --> 00:12:04.890 line:78%
RUSSIA'S NUCLEAR FORCES ON HIGH

00:12:03.756 --> 00:12:06.392 line:78%
ALERT, AND AGAIN, RUSSIA HAS THE

00:12:04.990 --> 00:12:09.829 line:78%
LARGEST NUCLEAR ARSENAL IN THE

00:12:06.492 --> 00:12:10.696 line:78%
WORLD, AND AGAIN, WHY WOULDN'T

00:12:09.929 --> 00:12:11.864 line:78%
HE USE THOSE WEAPONS?

00:12:10.796 --> 00:12:15.501 line:78%
THEY TELL US DAILY HE IS EVIL

00:12:11.964 --> 00:12:16.268 line:78%
AND INSANE AND HE MAY WELL BE.

00:12:15.901 --> 00:12:16.902 line:78%
A RISK?

00:12:16.702 --> 00:12:17.670 line:78%
YEAH.

00:12:17.002 --> 00:12:20.306 line:78%
BUT NO ONE IN WASHINGTON SEEMS

00:12:17.770 --> 00:12:21.507 line:78%
WORRIED IN THE SLIGHTEST.

00:12:20.740 --> 00:12:22.308 line:78%
IN FACT, CONGRESSMAN

00:12:21.607 --> 00:12:23.476 line:78%
ADAM KINZINGER, WITH CLEARLY

00:12:22.408 --> 00:12:25.878 line:78%
SOMETHING TO LOOK FOR AT THIS

00:12:23.576 --> 00:12:26.679 line:78%
POINT, IS NOT GOING TO A BLANK

00:12:25.978 --> 00:12:27.580 line:78%
CHECK I'M AN OPEN-ENDED CONFLICT

00:12:26.946 --> 00:12:30.316 line:78%
IN UKRAINE USING THE SAME LEGAL

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:31.817 line:78%
JUSTIFICATION THAT GOT US INTO

00:12:30.416 --> 00:12:33.486 line:78%
IRAQ FOR NEARLY 20 YEARS.

00:12:31.917 --> 00:12:34.887 line:78%
HE WANTS AN AUTHORIZATION TO USE

00:12:33.586 --> 00:12:35.187 line:78%
MILITARY FORCE.

00:12:34.987 --> 00:12:35.955 line:78%
WATCH.

00:12:35.287 --> 00:12:38.491 line:78%
&gt;&gt; SENATOR KAINE WAS WITH US AND

00:12:36.155 --> 00:12:39.225 line:78%
HE SAID IT IS TOO SOON TO BEGIN

00:12:38.591 --> 00:12:40.559 line:78%
TALKING ABOUT POTENTIAL USE OF

00:12:39.325 --> 00:12:43.129 line:78%
FORCE IN UKRAINE.

00:12:40.659 --> 00:12:46.065 line:78%
DO YOU THINK IS RIGHT?

00:12:45.064 --> 00:12:46.432 line:78%
&gt;&gt; NO.

00:12:46.165 --> 00:12:47.733 line:78%
I DON'T.

00:12:46.532 --> 00:12:48.901 line:78%
I DON'T THINK WE NEED TO BE

00:12:47.833 --> 00:12:49.168 line:78%
USING FORCE IN UKRAINE RIGHT

00:12:49.001 --> 00:12:51.670 line:78%
NOW.

00:12:49.268 --> 00:12:53.873 line:78%
I JUST INTRODUCED AN

00:12:51.771 --> 00:12:55.508 line:78%
AUTHORIZATION FOR THE USE OF

00:12:53.973 --> 00:12:56.041 line:78%
MILITARY FORCE GIVING THE

00:12:55.608 --> 00:12:57.643 line:78%
PRESIDENT BASICALLY

00:12:56.142 --> 00:13:00.980 line:78%
CONGRESSIONAL LEVERAGE OR

00:12:57.743 --> 00:13:02.047 line:78%
PERMISSION TO USE IT IF WMDs,

00:13:01.113 --> 00:13:02.681 line:78%
NUCLEAR BIOLOGICAL OR CHEMICAL

00:13:02.148 --> 00:13:03.849 line:78%
OR USE IN UKRAINE.

00:13:02.782 --> 00:13:04.150 line:78%
DOES IT COMPEL THE PRESIDENT TO

00:13:03.949 --> 00:13:06.919 line:78%
DO IT?

00:13:04.250 --> 00:13:07.453 line:78%
IT JUST SAYS IF IT IS USED HE

00:13:07.019 --> 00:13:08.320 line:78%
HAS THAT LEVERAGE.

00:13:07.553 --> 00:13:10.589 line:78%
THEY MAY BE A POINT WHERE WE

00:13:08.420 --> 00:13:12.324 line:78%
HAVE TO RECOGNIZE, LOOK, THIS

00:13:10.689 --> 00:13:15.027 line:78%
IS -- PRIOR TO WORLD WAR II

00:13:12.424 --> 00:13:15.895 line:78%
THERE WERE MOMENTS NOBODY EVER

00:13:15.127 --> 00:13:17.296 line:78%
WANTED TO GET INVOLVED AND

00:13:15.995 --> 00:13:17.630 line:78%
EVENTUALLY CAME TO REALIZE THEY

00:13:17.396 --> 00:13:18.297 line:78%
HAD TO.

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:19.999 line:78%
I HOPE WE DON'T GET TO THAT

00:13:18.397 --> 00:13:22.468 line:78%
POINT HERE, BUT WE SHOULD BE

00:13:20.099 --> 00:13:23.002 line:78%
